Package: x11-fonts-sf
Name: San Francisco fonts for X11
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Depends: fontconfig
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Description: San Francisco as the default X11 font
 Exposes the live iOS system fonts to X11/fontconfig apps and makes San Francisco the
 default: .SF UI for sans-serif/serif/system-ui and .SF UI Mono for monospace (terminals,
 code). No font files are copied or redistributed - fontconfig is pointed straight at
 /System/Library/Fonts, so it always tracks the OS and picks up emoji + CJK for free.
